Spec: Home

Purpose:
  Home tab: greeting, distance hero card, recent rides, favourites and the ride start.

Owns:
  ./*.dart
  /test/home

References:
  /docs/specs/history/10-home.md

Must:
  The hero card shows week, day and year distance and a stat row for the chosen period (stored as
    `home_stats_period`).
  Recent rides are the two newest; favourites the two most recently favourited.
  Ride rows without a map show a navigate-to-start button when the ride has a route; Android hands a `geo:`
    URI to the system chooser, iOS offers Apple Maps plus installed Google Maps or Waze.
  Greetings show every entry once per cycle before reshuffling and never repeat across the cycle boundary.
  Starting while a ride records reopens that ride.
  Otherwise the start stores the activity, clears a followed route, warns when offline, runs the permission
    gate and opens the countdown.
